+The original request chose a clean rename with no `summary` alias. Revisit this if the user changes that requirement.
+
+## Verification
+
+The worker reported `python3 -m unittest` passing and `python3 -m tally report` printing `food 12.25` and `total 12.25` in its own checkout with throwaway data. These results predate this partial integration and are not proof of the current checkout. No local checks have been run since applying the parser hunk.
+
+## Resume
+
+Read the current instructions and inspect Git state, `tally/cli.py`, `test_tally.py`, README and `docs/verification/category-totals.md`. Confirm the user's current intent, finish the missing integration, then check the affected paths. Do not rework expense persistence.
